.TH "SBCLAUDE" "1" "Aug 07, 2026" "0.0.1" "sbclaude"
.SH NAME
sbclaude \- sbclaude v0.0.1
.sp
Run Claude Code in a throwaway Docker container with no sandbox and no permission prompts, against configurable host mounts, with an optional mobile reverse\-engineering toolchain.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS sbclaude
.sp
Run Claude Code in a throwaway Docker container (no sandbox, no prompts).
.sp
With no subcommand, behaves like \fIsbclaude run\fP using config defaults.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sbclaude [OPTIONS] [COMMAND] [ARGS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
