.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-project <project>
Project dir (read\-write, becomes the workdir). Default: cwd.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-w, \-\-rw <rw_extra>
Extra read\-write mount.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-ro <ro_extra>
Extra read\-only mount.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-name <name>
Container name (default: sbclaude\-<project>).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-i, \-\-image <image>
Image override.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-debian\-mirror <debian_mirror>
Debian archive mirror to bake in if the image is (re)built, e.g. \X'tty: link http://ftp.us.debian.org/debian'\fI\%http://ftp.us.debian.org/debian\fP\X'tty: link'\&.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-memory <memory>
Docker memory limit, e.g. 8g. Default auto\-caps from host RAM; \(aq0\(aq disables. Only applied when hardening is on.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-cpus <cpus>
Docker CPU limit, e.g. 4. Only applied when hardening is on.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-R, \-\-re
Enable the Ghidra and Android host mounts together.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-ghidra
Mount host Ghidra (read\-only).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gpu
Expose the host GPUs.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-android
Mount Android SDK + ~/.android + kvm.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-usb
Expose /dev/bus/usb for adb.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-ios
Mount the host usbmuxd socket so frida can reach an iOS device.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-x11
Forward DISPLAY + XAUTHORITY for GUIs.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-ssh
Mount the host ~/.ssh read\-only and forward the ssh\-agent for SSH git remotes.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-gpg
Mount the host GnuPG home and agent socket for signing commits.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-net <network>
Docker network mode (default: host; use \(dqbridge\(dq to isolate).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-e, \-\-env <env_extra>
Extra env var KEY=VALUE for the box, e.g. \-e CLAUDE_CODE_USE_BEDROCK=1.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-harden
Disable the container hardening flags (cap\-drop, no\-new\-privileges, ...).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-session\-recover
Install cc\-session\-recover (auto\-resume) into the project on start.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable debug level logging.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Arguments
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B CLAUDE_ARGS
Optional argument(s)
.UNINDENT
