.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
sbclaude stop [OPTIONS]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-name <name>
Container name. Default: every box for the current project.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-all
Stop every sbclaude container.
.UNINDENT
